        "source": "plugins.samsite",
        "name": "Samsite landing v0.1.0",
        "description": "Landing page: cytoscape graph panel projecting the samsite-tagged AWS resources for account 180731181784. The aws_account container node is no longer minted here \u2014 the aws_core boto3 collector now synthesizes it (aws_account_singleton custom_fn, deterministic uuid5); the samsite multi-MATCH search's MATCH (account:aws_account) resolves against the collector-owned node."
